WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.320
Billing shows what's due, your invoices, and how to pay.

2
00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:12.350
Choose how you'd like to pay: card, Interac e-Transfer, or direct debit from your bank.

3
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:22.160
To pay faster next time, add a card or bank account. Your details go straight to the payment processor; the centre never sees them.

4
00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:30.170
Once a payment method is saved, you can turn on autopay, and each invoice is paid automatically on its due date.

5
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:35.830
Every payment gives you a receipt, and your full history stays here in Billing.
